@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title 循序圖：客服工單

actor 使用者 as User
actor 客服管理員 as Staff
participant "SupportTicketScreen" as UI
participant "AdminTicketScreen" as AdminUI
participant "ApiService(SupportApi)" as ApiSvc
participant "POST /api/support/tickets" as CreateRoute
participant "support.js" as SupportSvc
participant "support-attachments.js" as AttachSvc
database "Prisma / MariaDB" as DB

User -> UI : 附上截圖並填寫問題
UI -> ApiSvc : uploadSupportImage(file)
ApiSvc -> AttachSvc : 暫存附件，回傳簽章連結
UI -> ApiSvc : createTicket(subject, category, content, attachments)
ApiSvc -> CreateRoute : POST /api/support/tickets
CreateRoute -> SupportSvc : open(userId, subject, content, attachments)
SupportSvc -> SupportSvc : 檢查同時開啟中工單 < 5 筆
SupportSvc -> AttachSvc : assertClaimable(attachments)
SupportSvc -> DB : tx.support_tickets.create(status='open')
SupportSvc -> DB : tx.support_ticket_messages.create(is_staff=false)
SupportSvc -> AttachSvc : claim(attachments)
SupportSvc -> DB : notifySupportStaff(具can_manage_support權限之管理員)
SupportSvc --> UI : 201 建立成功

Staff -> AdminUI : 開啟工單並回覆
AdminUI -> ApiSvc : replyTicket(ticketId, content)
ApiSvc -> SupportSvc : reply(ticketId, staff, content)
SupportSvc -> SupportSvc : findAccessibleTicket(本人或具權限管理員)
SupportSvc -> DB : support_ticket_messages.create(is_staff=true)
SupportSvc -> DB : support_tickets.status='pending'（等待使用者）
SupportSvc -> DB : notify 使用者
SupportSvc --> AdminUI : 200 OK

User -> UI : 查看回覆後結案
UI -> ApiSvc : closeTicket(ticketId)
ApiSvc -> SupportSvc : close(ticketId)
SupportSvc -> DB : support_tickets.update(status='closed', closed_at=now)
SupportSvc --> UI : 200 已結案
@enduml
